  "body": "Complete research backup for the 2026-11-04 hybrid-specificity and distillation follow-ups.\n\nFour settings compare conditional/shared with shared/shared mixtures; three settings contain 18 new paired residual fits. Includes raw masks, scores, targets, new weights, nine shared bases, nine conditioned teachers, recovery inputs and independent audits. All fixed seeds and settings are retained. Reserved final-test data was not used.\n\nSmall results and figures: results/hybrid-followup-v1/. Recovery code: scripts/verify_hybrid_archive.py. Source and curated results commit: aed48fcce1814b6866b819554441653d33c635e3.\n\nArchives total 513,230,325 bytes. Local restoration and authenticated GitHub byte-range restoration both passed. Prior original-target fits and A endpoint sources remain in earlier backup releases, as recorded in backup_manifest.json."
